# Pixi wrappers & Builder

## Wrappers

- Subclass the Pixi display type; construct `GameObjectProxy`; forward GameObject API.
- Override child mutators (`addChild`, `removeChild`, …) to call proxy `onChildAdded` / `onChildDetached` / destroy path.
- `asX()` casts: return `this` for own type; throw for others.
- Destroy: detach from Colfio parent via `destroyChild` when parented, then Pixi `destroy`.

## Builder

- Add new object kinds via `ObjectType`, `asX` method, and `process()` switch.
- Support factory components (`() => Component`) for reusable builders.
- Keep position helpers accepting `number | Vector` with single-arg mirroring.
- Do not reorder `process()` so that parenting happens before components/attributes without a strong reason — notifications and scene indexes depend on order.

See `docs/source-map.md`.
